  "sandbox_stdout": "Parent: n=256, C5=0.38089931\n\n=== Phase 1: L-BFGS-B at parent n=256 ===\n\n=== Phase 2: Multi-resolution ===\n  n=224: C5=0.38153639\n  n=288: C5=0.38140369\n  n=192: C5=0.38198784\n  n=320: C5=0.38110739\n  n=384: C5=0.38144803\n  n=448: C5=0.38110673\n  n=512: C5=0.38104529\n  n=576: C5=0.38105017\n  n=640: C5=0.38100794\n\n=== Phase 3: Aggressive re-optimization ===\n\n=== Phase 4: Smart coordinate descent ===\n  After coord descent: C5=0.38089931\n\n=== Phase 5: High-beta polish ===\n  Final coord: C5=0.38089931\n\nFINAL: n=256, C5=0.38089931",
